          y0: 90, tspan: [0, 40], ylim: [0, 100], exact: 'Ta + (90 - Ta)*exp(-k*t)', hlines: ['Ta'],
          readout: String.raw`$T(t) = T_a + (T_0 - T_a)e^{-kt}$. Time to reach $40\,°$C: $\frac1k\ln\frac{90 - T_a}{40 - T_a} = {{log((90-Ta)/(40-Ta))/k}}$ min.`,
